{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d1d6006945d280a774","chatId":"867cfcebc1dd486ca89f312c51ba6f88","sessionId":null,"userId":68947,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"D\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"D\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1001,"promptTokens":1440,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:25"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607825469210064,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d1d6006945d280a773","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369745959,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8d1d6006945d280a773","chatId":"867cfcebc1dd486ca89f312c51ba6f88","sessionId":null,"userId":68947,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n安其拉有蜜蜂恐惧症，当蜜蜂飞来飞去的时候，她会非常紧张。今天，我送给她一瓶蜂蜜。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，安其拉最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 紧张\nB) 害怕\nC) 反对\nD) 反感\nE) 感激\nF) 气恼\n\n## 问题 2\n安其拉为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她很感激这份礼物\nB) 这份礼物增加了她对蜜蜂的恐惧\nC) 这蜂蜜来自稀有的蜜蜂\nD) 她认为我没有考虑到她的恐惧症","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607825469210064,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d1d6006945d280a774","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369745956,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:25","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"a83b59b8a92f4816a2befd75fd8742b2"}